<title>USA: E.W. Scripps unit names president/CEO.</title>
<headline>E.W. Scripps unit names president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinetel Productions, a unit of E.W. Scripps Co, said Monday it has named Eric Ober as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Ober is a former president of CBS News, a unit of Westinghouse Electric Corp. Cinetel is an independent producer of programming for cable television networks.</p>
<p>The posts of president and chief executive at Cinetel are newly created, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
